<title>PHILIPPINES: A Brown sets 25 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>A Brown sets 25 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Brown Co Inc said on Wednesday its board of directors had approved a 25 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The record date will be determined by the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>A Brown told the Philippine Stock Exchange the dividend would be taken from its unissued shares and from an increase of authorised capital.</p>
<p>The company is involved in real estate development, chemical manufacturing, consumer products distribution and agribusiness.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
